Usage: ruralz bundle build [DIR] [FLAGS]

Build a Revision, print its digest.

Builds the Revision of one Environment and prints rev-<12 hex> and its full
digest. The online Plugin check runs unless --offline is set; fetching Plugin
artifacts is Planned (M2), so a Bundle that holds a Plugin needs --offline.
--output-file receives the ruralz.canonical.v1 content, which hashes to the
digest.

Arguments:
  DIR  Bundle directory, one-file Bundle, or - for standard input (default .)

Flags:
  --env NAME           Render with this Environment's overlay and variables, read from --environments
  --environments FILE  Local Environment resources
  --help               Print this help
  --offline            Skip the online Plugin check
  --output text|json   Output format (text or json, default text)
  --output-file PATH   Write the canonical content (ruralz.canonical.v1) to PATH
